## 11. Visual direction (free hand within this)

Premium dark fintech, calm and data-dense but airy. Near-black navy background, slightly lighter cards (1px subtle border, ~16px radius, no heavy shadows), one teal-green accent for positive/primary, a muted red only for destructive. Sans UI font (Inter or Manrope), **tabular/mono figures for all money, % and dates**, an elegant serif only for large greetings/page titles if it looks good. Pill tab bar, thin line icons, small tinted badges. Primary / secondary (ghost) / destructive button styles at consistent height. FinPilot modal visually distinct from the host (own header, stepper, "Powered by FinPilot"). Minimum 12px text, light grey secondary text with AA contrast.

