## 12. Acceptance tests (put the engine ones in `impactEngine.test.ts`; allow ±1% tolerance)

Assumptions: 12% p.a., n and goals exactly as in section 4.

| Case | Expected |
|---|---|
| Early Retirement baseline | projected ≈ ₹1,26,70,000 (≈105.6% of target) → **On track**; months to target ≈ **188** |
| Pause UTI ₹10,000 for **3 months** | value lost ≈ **₹1,82,189**; goal delay ≈ **2 months**; status stays On track (~104%) |
| Pause UTI ₹10,000 for **12 months** | goal delay ≈ **6 months**; status → **Slightly behind** (~99.8%) |
| Withdraw **₹5,18,000** (full UTI) | value lost ≈ **₹32,05,676**; goal delay ≈ **27 months**; status On track → **At risk** (~78.9%) |
| Withdraw **25%** (₹1,29,500) | value lost ≈ ₹8,01,419; goal delay ≈ **7 months**; status → Slightly behind (~98.9%) |
| Home goal baseline | ≈ **103.9%** of ₹9,50,000 → On track; months to target ≈ **45** |
| Reduce Parag Parikh ₹8,000 → ₹5,500 | value lost ≈ **₹1,47,208** (sum over whole horizon); goal delay ≈ **10 months** |

UI checks:
1. Landing → Try Demo → SIPs → Pause SIP reaches the modal in ≤ 3 clicks.
2. "Market worry" on UTI pause shows the **You've been here before** card (₹2,140 missed gains); "Found a better option" shows none.
3. Delete a memory record → it no longer matches. Confirm a decision → a new record appears next run.
4. Withdraw ₹50,000 with ₹62,000 cash → **Use available cash instead** is shown; withdraw ₹5,18,000 → it is **hidden**.
5. Type 0, a negative number, or more than the holding → inline error, Done disabled.
6. Demo panel Slow → numbers only + fallback note; Fast → typed explanation.
7. After Done: SIP badge, dashboard totals, goal card, Activity log, check-in and toast all update; refresh keeps state; **Reset demo** restores seed.
8. Only one "…anyway" control exists; no duplicate option cards.
9. No "$", "Jonathan Doe", "QQQ", "VOO" anywhere. No "Sips"/"sips" casing errors.
10. No horizontal overflow at 1280 and 1440 widths; Esc closes the modal; focus stays inside it.

