## 13. Deploy on Vercel

1. `npm create vite@latest` (React + TS), add Tailwind, Recharts, Vitest.
2. `npm run test` must pass; `npm run build` outputs `dist/`.
3. Add `vercel.json` so refreshes on sub-pages don't 404:
   ```json
   { "rewrites": [{ "source": "/(.*)", "destination": "/index.html" }] }
   ```
   (Or use hash-based navigation.)
4. Push to GitHub → import in Vercel (framework auto-detected: Vite) → deploy.
5. Open the live URL in an **incognito window** and walk through every flow before submitting.

