## 14. Out of scope (do not build)

Real login/signup, payments, a backend or database, real LLM calls, RAG, real market data feeds, mobile layouts (desktop-first only), FinPilot modals on Add Investment (it only shows the one-line insight).

---

## 15. Production architecture (for the deck, not built here)

Host app → **FinPilot API** (pseudonymous payload) → **Deterministic Impact Engine** (server/edge) ← **market data** (AMFI NAV, NSE/BSE index feeds) → **LLM** writes wording only from a facts JSON → **number validator** rejects any figure not in the facts → client renders; **Decision Memory** store (category + outcome per pseudonymous ID; outcomes back-filled by a job comparing NAV after the decision). RAG, if used, retrieves only approved explanatory text (factsheet snippets, exit-load and tax notes) for citations, never numbers. Consent-based memory, DPDP Act 2023 aligned; FinPilot advises only and never executes.
